AUDIO: 'there\'s one surprise setting that I didn\'t really expect to find on this camera. It has Wi-Fi. When you enable Wi-Fi, the camera displays a QR code. You scan that with your phone and'

[05:36] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'connect to the camera. And surprisingly, the Wi-Fi actually works really well. The connection and setup are very fast. You access the camera through a very simple web interface. From there, you'

